      "statement": "Each call spawns `codebase-memory-mcp cli --json <tool>` once and parses the raw MCP result envelope — the same daemon the MCP server fronts, so indexes, project mutation locks, and the index supervisor are fully shared; warm daemon calls cost about 0.2 s on this machine and cold spawn about 1.3 s.",
